IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa3-part8-subsidiary`

-- coa3-tests-subsidiary.l4: tests for coa3-part8-subsidiary.l4 (ss 136 to 144).
-- Every expected value is written by hand from the text of the section named beside it, before the code was run.

-- ---- s 136(2): "The exceptions are provided for in— section 138 ..., and section 141" ----
#ASSERT `s 136(2) the exception is provided for in the provision` `s 136(2) section 138 (subsidiary acting as personal representative or trustee)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 136(2) the exception is provided for in the provision` `s 136(2) section 141 (subsidiary acting as authorised dealer in securities)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 136(2) the exception is provided for in the provision` `s 136(2) another provision of this Chapter` EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---- s 136(1)(a): arguments (s 1159(1) subsidiary) (s 137(1) may continue) (s 138(1) does not apply) (s 141(1) does not apply) ----
