#ASSERT `s 137(2) the relevant date for the purposes of s 137(1)(a)` Scotland EQUALS Date 1 7 1948
#ASSERT `s 137(2) the relevant date for the purposes of s 137(1)(a)` `Northern Ireland` EQUALS Date 1 4 1961
